   0   3.90   6.15   4.80  1.00  Once upon a time, in a big green forest, there lived a little rabbit called Ruby.
   1  10.10   4.60   3.45  1.00  Hello! I'm Ruby! Today is Bobo's big picnic party!
   2  14.75   4.69   3.53  1.00  Ruby picked a basket full of crunchy orange carrots for the party.
   3  19.49   5.77   3.62  1.00  How many carrots? Let's count! One, two, three, four, five!
   4  25.31   5.75   4.20  1.00  Five carrots! I want to be the first one at the party! Hop, hop, hop!
