  17  86.92   4.46   2.51  1.00  I feel happy again! Hop, hop, hop!
  18  91.43   4.73   3.58  1.00  Then Ruby heard a little peep. Tilly the bird was stuck in a bush!
  19  96.21   3.83   2.68  1.00  Peep, peep! Help! My wing is caught in the leaves!
  20 100.09   7.44   2.49  1.00  Will Ruby stop to help? What do you think?
