  23 116.76   4.52   2.57  1.00  Peep, peep! Thank you, Ruby! You're so kind!
  24 121.33   6.16   5.01  1.00  Next, Ruby met Tom the turtle. He was very slow, and the party was far away.
  25 127.54   4.68   3.53  1.00  Oh dear... I'm so slow. I will miss the party.
  26 132.27   5.33   3.98  1.00  Hmm... if I help Tom, I will be even later. But Tom needs a friend!
  27 137.65   4.20   2.85  1.00  Climb into my basket, Tom! We'll go together!
  28 141.90   6.11   3.96  1.00  So Ruby hopped along, with Tom in her basket. Hop, hop, hop!
  29 148.06   3.58   2.43  1.00  Ruby was the very last one at the party.
  30 151.69   4.52   2.77  1.00  I'm late... and now I only have four carrots.
