  36 197.28   4.20   2.45  1.00  Hello, Mister Snowman! You are so cool!
  37 201.53   7.34   2.39  1.00  What happens to snow when the sun comes out?
  38 208.92   7.49   5.14  1.00  It melts back into water! And Drippy goes round again, in the water cycle.
