  32 128.84   6.39   4.84  1.00  Stand with the sun behind you, and the rain in front of you. Then look up!
  33 135.28   8.44   3.49  1.00  Game time! Where should the sun be? In front of you, or behind you?
  34 143.77   4.43   2.09  1.00  Behind me! And the rain in front!
  35 148.25   8.22   6.87  1.00  Wow fact! A rainbow is really a whole circle! From an airplane, you can sometimes see the full circle!
  36 156.52   5.84   3.49  1.00  A rainbow circle? Like a giant rainbow donut! Yum!
  37 162.41   8.21   5.86  1.00  And sometimes you can see two rainbows! A double rainbow! In the second one, the colors are upside down!
  38 170.67   3.93   1.98  1.00  Two rainbows? Double the fun!
  39 174.65   8.21   3.15  1.00  Hmm... can we see a rainbow at night, when there is no sun?
  40 182.91   6.10   3.75  1.00  No! A rainbow needs sunlight. No sun, no rainbow!
  41 189.06   4.38   3.03  1.00  Let's make our own rainbow! Ask a grown-up to help.
  42 193.49   4.63   2.88  1.00  Step one. Fill a clear glass with water.
  43 198.17   4.67   2.92  1.00  Step two. Put the glass in a sunny window.
  44 202.89   6.64   4.68  1.00  Step three. Hold a white paper on the floor, below the glass... and look!
  45 209.58   4.85   2.30  1.00  Ta-da! A little rainbow on the paper!
  46 214.48   7.51   2.55  1.00  Color game! What color comes after yellow?
  47 222.04   3.06   0.91  1.00  Green!
  48 225.15   7.29   2.34  1.00  What color is at the top of the rainbow?
  49 232.49   4.58   2.23  1.00  Red! Red is always on top!
  50 237.12   2.42   1.27  1.00  Let's remember!
  51 239.59   6.72   1.77  1.00  What two things make a rainbow?
  52 246.36   3.61   1.66  1.00  Sunlight and raindrops!
  53 250.02   6.84   1.89  1.00  How many colors are in the rainbow?
  54 256.91   2.80   0.85  1.00  Seven!
  55 259.76   6.99   2.04  1.00  Where is the sun when you see a rainbow?
  56 266.80   2.84   0.89  1.00  Behind you!
  57 269.69   6.32   1.37  1.00  What color is on top?
  58 276.06   2.63   0.68  1.00  Red!
  59 278.74   6.78   1.83  1.00  What shape is a rainbow, really?
  60 285.57   3.21   1.06  1.00  A circle!
  61 288.83   2.34   1.49  1.00  Let's say it together!
  62 291.22   2.04   1.19  1.00  Sun behind!
  63 293.31   2.00   1.15  1.00  Rain in front!
  64 295.36   1.87   1.02  1.00  Seven colors!
  65 297.28   2.93   1.38  1.00  Rainbow bright!
  66 300.26   7.34   4.39  1.00  Your turn! Sun behind! Rain in front! Seven colors! Rainbow bright!
  67 307.65   3.61   2.66  1.00  Thanks for making a rainbow with me! Bye-bye!
  68 311.31   6.44   1.75  1.00  See you next time, friends!
